(wire (pts (xy 213.36 101.60) (xy 215.90 101.60)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "662b59e2-ef22-4261-9a87-a8a7bdbe1dbd"))
(label "IO7" (at 215.90 101.60 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "880f34a8-88fc-43a5-abf1-d093210ffd9f"))
(text "1Gbit SLC NAND flash, x8 parallel (ONFI 1.0), 25 ns, 2.7-3.6 V, TSOP-48 12x20 - W29N01HVSINA\nLAYOUT: 100 nF on EACH VCC pin (12, 37) within 2 mm + one 1 uF; VSS pins 13/36 via directly to GND plane. Pins 20/38 are DNU - leave unconnected.\nRoute IO0-IO7, CLE, ALE, WE#, RE# as one group over solid GND; length-match the group to +/-5 mm, keep < 75 mm, load <= 30 pF (datasheet test load).\nWE#/RE# are the timing strobes: 27R source termination within 5 mm of host, no stubs. IO/CLE/ALE/CE# 0R footprints let you fit 27R after SI check.\nRY/BY# open drain needs the 10k pull-up; WP# 10k pull-down holds VIL at power-up/down as recommended. 1-bit+ ECC (BCH/Hamming) required by host.\nTypical use: MPU / FPGA bulk storage on a parallel NAND controller (FMC/EMIF/GPMC). Rename NAND bus labels to your controller nets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "75182f16-5068-4b88-a35c-870aa923a7f8"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
